<title>UK: T&amp;B says has over 90 pct of Applied.</title>
<headline>T&amp;B says has over 90 pct of Applied.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British transport firm Tibbett &amp; Britten Group Plc said on Monday it had acceptances for over 90 percent of the issued ordinary share capital of Applied Distribution Group Plc.</p>
<p>Tibbett said in mid-May that it was offering one new share for every 13 shares held in Applied Distribution, valuing the company at around 16.8 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
